{"suttaId":"an4.42","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"A-iv","vriCode":"s0402m3.mul","paras":[465,473],"vripara":"42"},"segments":{"an4.42:0.3":"Pañhabyākaraṇasuttaṃ","an4.42:1.1":"“Cattārimāni, bhikkhave, pañhabyākaraṇāni [pañhābyākaraṇāni (ka.)].","an4.42:1.2":"Katamāni cattāri?","an4.42:1.3":"Atthi, bhikkhave, pañho ekaṃsabyākaraṇīyo;","an4.42:1.4":"atthi, bhikkhave, pañho vibhajjabyākaraṇīyo;","an4.42:1.5":"atthi, bhikkhave, pañho paṭipucchābyākaraṇīyo;","an4.42:1.6":"atthi, bhikkhave, pañho ṭhapanīyo.","an4.42:1.7":"Imāni kho, bhikkhave, cattāri pañhabyākaraṇānī”ti.","an4.42:2.1":"“Ekaṃsavacanaṃ ekaṃ, vibhajjavacanāparaṃ;","an4.42:2.3":"Tatiyaṃ paṭipuccheyya, catutthaṃ pana ṭhāpaye.","an4.42:3.1":"“Yo ca tesaṃ [nesaṃ (sī. syā. kaṃ.)] tattha tattha, jānāti anudhammataṃ;","an4.42:3.3":"Catupañhassa kusalo, āhu bhikkhuṃ tathāvidhaṃ.","an4.42:4.1":"“Durāsado duppasaho, gambhīro duppadhaṃsiyo;","an4.42:4.3":"Atho atthe anatthe ca, ubhayassa hoti kovido [ubhayatthassa kovido (syā. kaṃ.)].","an4.42:5.1":"“Anatthaṃ parivajjeti, atthaṃ gaṇhāti paṇḍito;","an4.42:5.3":"Atthābhisamayā dhīro, paṇḍitoti pavuccatī”ti.","an4.42:5.5":"dutiyaṃ;"},"attha":{"book":"Mp-iv","bookName":"Catukkanipāta-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0402a.att","from":1234,"to":1234,"paras":[{"para":1234,"vripara":"42","refs":["an4.42:3","an4.42:4","an4.42:5"],"lines":["Dutiye <b>yo ca tesaṃ tattha tattha, jānāti anudhammatan</b>ti yo etesaṃ pañhānaṃ tasmiṃ tasmiṃ ṭhāne byākaraṇaṃ jānāti.","<b>Catupañhassa kusalo, āhu bhikkhuṃ tathāvidhan</b>ti tathāvidhaṃ bhikkhuṃ tesu catūsu pañhesu kusaloti evaṃ vadanti.","<b>Durāsado duppasaho</b>ti parehi ghaṭṭetuṃ vā abhibhavituṃ vā na sakkā.","<b>Gambhīro</b>ti sattasīdantaramahāsamuddo viya gambhīro.","<b>Duppadhaṃsiyo</b>ti dummocāpayo, gahitaggahaṇaṃ vissajjāpetuṃ na sakkāti attho.","<b>Atthe anatthe cā</b>ti vaḍḍhiyañca avaḍḍhiyañca.","<b>Atthābhisamayā</b>ti atthasamāgamena.","<b>Dhīro paṇḍitoti pavuccatī</b>ti dhitisampanno puggalo “paṇḍito ayan”ti evaṃ pavuccati."],"lineRefs":[["an4.42:3"],["an4.42:3"],["an4.42:4"],["an4.42:4"],["an4.42:4"],["an4.42:4"],["an4.42:5"],["an4.42:5"]]}],"wordLinks":[["an4.42:3.1","yo ca tesaṃ tattha tattha jānāti anudhammataṃ",0,0],["an4.42:3.3","catupañhassa kusalo āhu bhikkhuṃ tathāvidhaṃ",0,1],["an4.42:4.1","durāsado duppasaho",0,2],["an4.42:4.1","gambhīro",0,3],["an4.42:4.1","duppadhaṃsiyo",0,4],["an4.42:4.3","atthe anatthe cā",0,5],["an4.42:5.3","atthābhisamayā",0,6],["an4.42:5.3","dhīro paṇḍitoti pavuccatī",0,7]]},"tika":null}
